'''Team Star Grunt''' (Japanese: '''スター団のしたっぱ''' ''Team Star Underling'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter card}} in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Discard a random Energy from among the Energy attached to all of your opponent's Pokémon that have an {{TCG|Ability}}.
}}

