==Trivia==
{{TCG|Team Star Grunt}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*{{tc|Team Star Grunt}}s are [[grunt]] members of [[Team Star]]. Both male and female grunts, as they appear in {{g|Scarlet}}, are depicted in this card's illustrations.
*Both of this card's illustrations were first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Team Star Grunt|195}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.

